  "name": "Assisted Reload",
  "type": "feat",
  "effects": [],
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "gm": "",
      "value": "<div><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><strong>Requirements</strong> You are within 30 feet of a non-sygican ally.</p><hr></div><p class=\"MsoNormal\">You know how to rely on your magic-bearing allies to help use everything at your disposal when you can’t do it yourself. You Reload a piece of magical ammunition into your firearm, but request assistance from your allies to Activate it. An ally in range can Activate the ammunition for you as a reaction, or as a free action if they can Cast a Spell as you reload your weapon.</p>"
